{"id":"066b967b5aa37dce","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-Ktrivial-width.md","title":"固定K平凡常数的初段宽度界","display":"thm-Ktrivial-width — 固定K平凡常数的初段宽度界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-Ktrivial-width","aliases":["43-thm-Ktrivial-width"],"display":"thm-Ktrivial-width — 固定K平凡常数的初段宽度界","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.1.8; Corollary 15.1.9(a); printed pp.411–412 / PDF pp.431–432","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-Ktrivial-width"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-Ktrivial-width</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Ktrivial-width — 固定K平凡常数的初段宽度界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.1.8; Corollary 15.1.9(a); printed pp.411–412 / PDF pp.431–432"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 与自然数编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_d\">\\(\\mathcal T_d\\)</span> 是下式定义的序列类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_d\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_d\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall d,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:K(\\sigma)\\le K(n)+d\\}\\right|\\le c2^d\\land|\\mathcal T_d|\\le c2^d\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall d,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:K(\\sigma)\\le K(n)+d\\}\\right|\\le c2^d\\land|\\mathcal T_d|\\le c2^d\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源15.1.8采用严格小于；将d换成d+1并吸收固定因子2，得到与现有K平凡定义一致的≤形式。无限路径数不超过任何层的统一宽度，得到同阶的实数个数界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.1.8; Corollary 15.1.9(a); printed pp.411–412 / PDF pp.431–432。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 与自然数编码见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]；$d,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathcal T_d$ 是下式定义的序列类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"d,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_d\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall d,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left|\\{\\sigma\\in2^n:K(\\sigma)\\le K(n)+d\\}\\right|\\le c2^d\\land|\\mathcal T_d|\\le c2^d\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-404","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-Ktrivial-width]] — 固定K平凡常数的初段宽度界"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848"]}